  "label": "Popsicle as a symbol of sweetness and enjoyment",
  "description": "A popsicle is a frozen, sweet treat commonly associated with pleasure, refreshment, and childhood innocence. In the context of the meme, it serves as a visual metaphor for 'all these flavors' — implying a wide range of positive, enjoyable options. This cultural association is external knowledge required to interpret the contrast with 'salty'.",
